#: apps/absences/services.py:446
msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough, and since RD 1060/2022 the worker does not hand the "
"certificate to the employer."
msgstr ""
"O parte de baixa non se almacena. Abonda con rexistrar a ausencia, as súas "
"datas e o seu estado, e desde o RD 1060/2022 o traballador non entrega o "
"parte á empresa."

#: apps/absences/services.py:477
#, python-format
msgid "There is already leave recorded between %(from)s and %(to)s."
msgstr "Xa hai unha ausencia rexistrada entre o %(from)s e o %(to)s."

#: apps/absences/services.py:497
msgid ""
"Say which suspension it is: they carry different articles and different "
"consequences, and the record has to name one."
msgstr ""
"Di que suspensión é: levan artigos e consecuencias distintas, e o rexistro "
"ten que nomear unha."

#: apps/absences/services.py:506
msgid ""
"A reduction covers whole days at a smaller share. For hours away on one day, "
"leave the reduction empty."
msgstr ""
"Unha redución cobre días enteiros cunha xornada menor. Para horas soltas dun "
"día, deixa a redución baleira."

#: apps/absences/services.py:515
msgid ""
"Only a suspension can reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr ""
"Só unha suspensión pode reducir a xornada. Para menos horas por acordo, "
"cambia as horas contratadas da persoa."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-28
#: apps/absences/services.py:538
#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(kind)s» cannot reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr ""
"«%(kind)s» non pode reducir a xornada. Para menos horas por acordo, cambia a "
"xornada contratada da persoa."

#: apps/absences/services.py:548
msgid ""
"Holiday is taken in whole days. For part of a day, use the leave type that "
"fits: a medical appointment, family emergency, an exam."
msgstr ""
"As vacacións collense por días completos. Para parte dun día usa o permiso "
"que corresponda: visita médica, forza maior familiar, un exame."

