#: apps/punches/corrections.py:144
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b: a change needs the authorisation of the company and of the person "
"concerned. Empty means they have not answered."
msgstr ""
"Art. 4.b: modificar un asento necesita a autorización da empresa e da persoa "
"afectada. Baleiro significa que aínda non respondeu."

