msgstr "como se lles informou"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:168
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b requires informing the workers' legal representation when there is "
"disagreement. If the company has not said who they are, that is recorded "
"here rather than passed over in silence."
msgstr ""
"O art. 4.b esixe informar a representación legal das persoas traballadoras "
"cando hai discrepancia. Se a empresa non dixo quen son, queda anotado aquí "
"en vez de pasalo por alto."

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:175
msgid "applied without agreement"
msgstr "aplicada sen acordo"

#: apps/punches/corrections.py:178
msgid ""
"The change went in anyway, which art. 4.b allows. It travels to the "
"inspection report: a reader has to be able to tell a correction both parties "
"accepted from one imposed over an objection."
msgstr ""
"O cambio aplicouse igualmente, cousa que o art. 4.b permite. Viaxa ao "
"informe de Inspección: quen o lea ten que poder distinguir unha corrección "
"aceptada polas dúas partes dunha imposta sobre unha obxección."

